[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652306347","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102712#issuecomment-2652306347","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102712","id":2652306347,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eFvur","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T23:42:15Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T23:42:15Z","body":"Thanks!\n\nI'll spend some more time digging into this later after putting together a project to test, but looking at this specific example, it seems like this might be the expected behavior:\n\n1. In GDScript, `[\"abc\"]` is an untyped `Array`, so I would expect it to match any array type on the Java side, and just attempt to convert all its elements to the Java type (which in this case I think would turn `\"abc\"` to `0`). I don't know if this actually works (I'll do some testing later), but this would at least need to be a typed `Array[String]` in GDScript, in order to not match with `IntArray` in Kotlin\n2. Calling a vararg function in GDScript is not equivalent to passing an array. So, I would expect something like `javaClass.testMethod(1, \"abc\", \"123\")` to match the vararg one, but not the example given above (`javaClass.testMethod(1,[\"asd\"])`). But I suspect that `JavaClassWrapper` doesn't support vararg methods at all at the moment - another thing I'll look into later :-)\n\nThat's not to say that even if this is the expected behavior for this example, that there aren't bugs here - but we may need to use a different example as a reference.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652306347/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657463558","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102712#issuecomment-2657463558","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102712","id":2657463558,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eZa0G","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T18:53:33Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T18:56:08Z","body":"I finally set up a test project and can confirm that there are some bugs here, namely:\n\n-  Method selection doesn't take typed arrays (including the `Packed*Array` types) into account when selected an overloaded method\n-  vararg methods aren't supported\n- Arrays of `JavaObject`s aren't supported (this one I noticed while working on this)\n\nI've started PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102817, which, so far, addresses only the first one.\n\nI'm sure we can fix them all, however, I'm not sure we'll manage it before Godot 4.4-stable's release - this may end up being something cherry-picked for 4.4.1.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657463558/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2661403565","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102712#issuecomment-2661403565","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102712","id":2661403565,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eocut","user":{"login":"SakuyaCN","id":26734975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzM0OTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26734975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakuyaCN","html_url":"https://github.com/SakuyaCN","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakuyaCN/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakuyaCN/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakuyaCN/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakuyaCN/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakuyaCN/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakuyaCN/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakuyaCN/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakuyaCN/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SakuyaCN/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-16T12:12:37Z","updated_at":"2025-02-16T12:12:37Z","body":"> 我终于搭建了一个测试项目，可以确认这里存在一些 bug，即：\n> \n> * 选择重载方法时，方法选择不考虑类型化数组（包括类型）`Packed*Array`\n> * 不支持 vararg 方法\n> * 不支持 s 数组（我在处理此内容时注意到这一点）`JavaObject`\n> \n> 我已经开始了 PR [#102817](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102817)，到目前为止，它只解决了第一个问题。\n> \n> 我确信我们可以修复它们，但是，我不确定我们能否在 Godot 4.4-stable 发布之前管理它 - 这最终可能会成为 4.4.1 的精选内容。\n\nI’m really looking forward to the further development of this feature!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2661403565/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2662522095","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102712#issuecomment-2662522095","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102712","id":2662522095,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6estzv","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/us